  <description>
    <p>
      AnyVector is a vector graphics editor for illustrations, layouts and logos. Its menus, toolbars,
      tools, property bars, dockers and dialogs follow the CorelDRAW layout, with the same captions,
      shortcuts and order.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Opens drawings saved by CorelDRAW, and SVG, PDF, EPS, PostScript, Adobe Illustrator, DXF and CMX files</li>
      <li>Shape, curve, text, table, dimension and connector tools, and effects such as blend, contour, envelope, extrude and drop shadow</li>
      <li>Bitmap effects, bitmap tracing and color management</li>
      <li>Publishes to PDF, including PDF/X and PDF/A, and prints with a preview and prepress options</li>
      <li>Interface in 15 languages</li>
    </ul>
    <p>CorelDRAW is a trademark of its owner. AnyVector is an independent product, not affiliated with it.</p>
  </description>
